# Phase 2 Integration Surfaces - Implementation Log

## P2.INTEG.E2B - E2B Adapter Interface
- Created IE2BAdapter interface defining contract for sandbox operations
- Location: services/sandbox/src/lib/adapters/e2b-adapter.interface.ts
- Methods: create, connect, executeCode, executeShell, executeBrowserAction, writeFile, readFile, listFiles, destroy, isActive, getStatus
- Supports SandboxConfig, ExecutionResult, FileOperation, BrowserAction types

## P2.INTEG.E2B_IMPL - E2B SDK Adapter Implementation
- Created E2BSdkAdapter implementing IE2BAdapter interface
- Location: services/sandbox/src/lib/adapters/e2b-sdk-adapter.ts
- Wraps @e2b/code-interpreter SDK with stub implementations
- Manages sandbox instances via in-memory Map
- All methods implemented as stubs ready for actual E2B SDK wiring

## P2.INTEG.E2B_FACTORY - E2B Adapter Factory
- Created E2BAdapterFactory for runtime adapter selection
- Location: services/sandbox/src/lib/adapters/adapter-factory.ts
- Supports feature flag-based adapter creation
- Methods: create (with feature flag), createExplicit (by type)

## P2.INTEG.CONNECTOR - Connector Adapter Interface
- Created IConnectorAdapter interface defining contract for third-party integrations
- Location: services/connector/src/lib/adapters/connector-adapter.interface.ts
- Methods: initiateOAuth, completeOAuth, refreshToken, revokeAccess, getConnectedAccounts, getConnectors, getConnector, getTools, executeTool, searchTools, validateCredentials
- Supports OAuth flows, connector catalog, and tool execution

## P2.INTEG.CONNECTOR_IMPL - Composio Adapter Implementation
- Created ComposioAdapter implementing IConnectorAdapter interface
- Location: services/connector/src/lib/adapters/composio-adapter.ts
- Wraps @composio/core SDK with stub implementations
- Lazy-initialized Composio client via getClient method
- All methods implemented as stubs ready for actual Composio SDK wiring

## P2.INTEG.CONNECTOR_FACTORY - Connector Adapter Factory
- Created ConnectorAdapterFactory for runtime adapter selection
- Location: services/connector/src/lib/adapters/adapter-factory.ts
- Supports feature flag-based adapter creation
- Methods: create (with feature flag), createExplicit (by type)

## P2.INTEG.FLAGS - Feature Flags
- Added enableE2BAdapter flag in packages/feature-flags/index.ts
- Added enableComposioAdapter flag in packages/feature-flags/index.ts
- Both flags use createFlag pattern with analytics integration
- Defaults to false, can be enabled per-user via feature flag service

## P2.INTEG.TESTS_E2B - E2B Adapter Tests
- Created comprehensive test suite for E2B adapter
- Location: services/sandbox/src/tests/e2b-adapter.test.ts
- Tests: Factory creation, interface compliance, error handling
- 18 tests covering all interface methods
- All tests passing

## P2.INTEG.TESTS_CONNECTOR - Connector Adapter Tests
- Created comprehensive test suite for Connector adapter
- Location: services/connector/src/tests/connector-adapter.test.ts
- Tests: Factory creation, interface compliance, OAuth flows, connector catalog, tool execution
- 23 tests covering all interface methods
- Mocked @composio/core SDK to avoid external dependencies
- All tests passing

## P2.INTEG.EXPORTS - Adapter Module Exports
- Updated services/sandbox/src/lib/adapters/index.ts to export all E2B adapter components
- Updated services/connector/src/lib/adapters/index.ts to export all connector adapter components
- Clean barrel exports for easy consumption

## Summary
- Phase 2 integration surfaces implemented with clean adapter pattern
- Both E2B and Connector/Composio adapters behind feature flags
- No breaking runtime cutover - all changes are additive
- 41 tests total (18 E2B + 23 Connector) - all passing
- Ready for gradual rollout via feature flags
